- Graphics data: tools/gfx/data/ and tools/gfx/logo/data/ (the demo's
  graphics in C64 form and the Oy Lohja AI emblem model) are not licensed
  under the MIT license. Copyright (c) 2026 Oy Lohja AI. All rights reserved.

- Logos and names of other groups, the party and real organisations that
  appear in the demo belong to their owners. Some maps and pictures were drawn
  from OpenStreetMap data (© OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL) and from the
  City of Lohja map service (including National Land Survey of Finland
  topographic data).

- Third-party software and fonts used by the build (Krill's loader, Blackbird,
  Caveat, Cinzel) are not part of this repository. tools/fetch-third-party.sh
  fetches them, and they keep their own licenses.
